window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Reign Harrow was the princess of rock until she randomly disappeared six months ago, taking her secrets and her fame with her.</b></p> <p>Now she's back, and she seems more determined than ever to be the best. To earn the awards and the titles others only dream of… and maybe even a little revenge along the way. To show everyone who wronged her just what she is made of.</p> <p>When her past collides with dreams, can Reign withstand the heat once more? Will she reach her crescendo, or will it be curtain fall?</p> <p>Tune in for tonight's show and find out.</p> <p>Long may she Reign!</p>"; 
